### Hotel Operations Platform Backend API Test Suite
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api/v1
@healthUrl = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Health Check
GET {{healthUrl}}/health

### -----------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. Authentication Module
### -----------------------------------------------------------------

### 2.1 Register New Guest
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jane Guest",
  "email": "janeguest@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 2.2 Login as Guest (Sets session_token cookie)
# @name guestLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "guest@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 2.3 Login as Admin (Sets session_token cookie)
# @name adminLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@hotel.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 2.4 Get Current User Profile (Protected)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me

### 2.5 Logout User
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout

### -----------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. Room & Inventory Management Module
### -----------------------------------------------------------------

### 3.1 Get All Public Room Types (Paginated with Filters)
GET {{baseUrl}}/rooms/types?page=1&limit=10&minPrice=100&maxPrice=500&capacity=2

### 3.2 Get Room Type Details by Slug
GET {{baseUrl}}/rooms/types/deluxe-king

### 3.3 Create New Room Type (Admin Only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/rooms/types
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Penthouse Sky Suite",
  "slug": "sky-suite",
  "description": "Ultra-luxury top floor penthouse with panoramic city views.",
  "basePrice": 850,
  "capacity": 2,
  "amenities": ["King Bed", "Private Pool", "Butler Service", "Helipad Access"],
  "images": ["https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1582719478250-c89cae4dc85b"]
}

### 3.4 Get All Physical Rooms (Staff / Admin Only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/rooms

### 3.5 Create Physical Room (Admin Only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomNumber": "401",
  "floor": 4,
  "roomTypeId": "deluxe-king"
}

### 3.6 Update Physical Room Status (Staff / Admin)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/rooms/room-id-placeholder/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "VACANT_CLEAN"
}

### -----------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. Booking Engine & Availability Module
### -----------------------------------------------------------------

### 4.1 Check Room Availability for Date Range
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/availability?checkInDate=2026-11-01&checkOutDate=2026-11-05

### 4.2 Create New Reservation (Guest Protected)
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomTypeId": "deluxe-king",
  "checkInDate": "2026-11-01",
  "checkOutDate": "2026-11-05"
}

### 4.3 Get Logged-in Guest Reservations
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/me?page=1&limit=10

### 4.4 Get Reservation Details by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/booking-id-placeholder

### 4.5 Cancel Reservation
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/bookings/booking-id-placeholder/cancel

### 4.6 Update Booking Status to CHECKED_IN (Staff / Admin)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/bookings/booking-id-placeholder/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "CHECKED_IN"
}

### -----------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. Multi-Gateway Payment Module
### -----------------------------------------------------------------

### 5.1 Initialize Stripe Payment Checkout
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/init
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookingId": "booking-id-placeholder",
  "provider": "STRIPE"
}

### 5.2 Initialize SSLCommerz Payment Checkout
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/init
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookingId": "booking-id-placeholder",
  "provider": "SSLCOMMERZ"
}

### 5.3 Mock SSLCommerz IPN Webhook Callback
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/webhook/sslcommerz
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "VALID",
  "tran_id": "SSLC_TEST_TX_ID",
  "val_id": "VAL_123456",
  "amount": "880.00",
  "currency": "USD"
}

### -----------------------------------------------------------------
### 6. In-Database Semantic RAG Engine Module
### -----------------------------------------------------------------

### 6.1 Ingest Knowledge Document Chunk with Vector Embedding (Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/rag/ingest
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Swimming Pool & Spa Hours",
  "content": "The rooftop infinity pool and wellness spa are open daily from 6:00 AM to 10:00 PM for all registered hotel guests.",
  "metadata": {
    "category": "amenities",
    "floor": 10
  }
}

### 6.2 Ask AI Concierge a Semantic Question (Public)
POST {{baseUrl}}/rag/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "What time does the swimming pool close?"
}

### -----------------------------------------------------------------
### 7. Autonomous Operations Agent & SSE Stream Module
### -----------------------------------------------------------------

### 7.1 Dispatch Autonomous Operations Agent Run (Staff / Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/agent/runs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "triggerEvent": "ROOM_TURNOVER",
  "prompt": "Room 201 was checked out. Assign housekeeping to clean the room with high priority."
}

### 7.2 Get Agent Run Status and Step Logs
GET {{baseUrl}}/agent/runs/run-id-placeholder

### 7.3 Approve Pending Agent Step (Admin HITL)
POST {{baseUrl}}/agent/runs/run-id-placeholder/steps/step-id-placeholder/approve
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "approved": true
}

### 7.4 Stream Real-time Agent Execution Logs (SSE)
GET {{baseUrl}}/agent/runs/run-id-placeholder/stream
